id: searx-modular-command-architecture
title: Decompose command and storage monoliths behind tested module boundaries
description: "Reduce change risk in the 2,660-line command dispatcher and 1,368-line storage module through incremental extraction and contract tests."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags[4]: architecture,coverage,maintainability,testing
