body: "The full audit found src/index.ts and src/storage/index.ts concentrating parsing, routing, IO, formatting, and lifecycle behavior. Plan incremental extractions rather than a rewrite: define stable seams, move one coherent command family at a time, add contract tests before movement, and ratchet per-file coverage as ownership becomes clearer."
